<title>USA: U.S. to sell $19.25 bln of 52-wk bills Oct 10.</title>
<headline>U.S. to sell $19.25 bln of 52-wk bills Oct 10.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Treasury said it will auction $19.25 billion of 52-week bills on Oct 10 to raise $775 million as $18.482 billion of 52-week bills are maturing.</p>
<p>The bills will be issued Oct 17 and mature Oct 16, 1997.</p>
<p>The CUSIP number for the bills will be 9127942V5.</p>
</text>
